        "notes": "The recipe (recipes/Qwen/Qwen-Image-2.1.md @ f69b1f2b1, checked 2026-10-10) puts BF16 peak GPU memory at 36.9 GB, and the default resident command OOMed at its dummy run on a 32 GB RTX 5090 (rdxa-5090-pa, 2026-10-10). The recipe's low-memory path is model-level CPU offload, which swaps the DiT and the text encoder (mutual exclusion). With CUDA-graph decode on (the default) the DiT keeps its device storage for the captured graphs, and the first request OOMed moving the text encoder in (measured 2026-10-10). The recipe's eager offload path, --no-enable-cuda-graph-decode, frees that storage. cuDNN attention as in this case's Blackwell profile. VALIDATION PENDING (2026-10-10 round).",
